{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/analogsim/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/analogsim/", "title": "Analog Simulation", "content_html": "<p><em>Article by MiSTer core developer Jegor van Opdorp (SupraDeus/jopdorp)</em></p>\n<p>Many old computers have analog parts \u2014 for example, audio boards with partly analog ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/analogsim.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:21:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mistercompile/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mistercompile/", "title": "Compiling for MiSTer", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer combines several compiled components: a customized minimal Linux kernel, a bootloader, the Main MiSTer binary written in C++, and cores built on the M...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/mistercompile.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:21:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/porting/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/porting/", "title": "Porting Cores", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer uses quite complex hardware, but thanks to open source, developers with different levels of hardware and software knowledge can develop for the platfo...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/porting.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:21:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/snippets/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/snippets/", "title": "Useful Snippets", "content_html": "<p>Here are some useful HDL snippets as used throughout the MiSTer project, with sources linked for reference.</p>\n<h2>Simple Pixel Clock Divider Using Clock Enable...</h2>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/snippets.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:21:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/analogsim/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/analogsim/", "title": "\u30a2\u30ca\u30ed\u30b0\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3", "content_html": "<p><em>\u8a18\u4e8b\uff1aMiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u958b\u767a\u8005 Jegor van Opdorp\uff08SupraDeus/jopdorp\uff09</em></p>\n<p>\u591a\u304f\u306e\u53e4\u3044\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u306b\u306f\u30a2\u30ca\u30ed\u30b0\u90e8\u54c1\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4f8b\u3048\u3070\u4e00\u90e8\u30a2\u30ca\u30ed\u30b0\u5408\u6210\u306e\u30aa\u30fc\u30c7\u30a3\u30aa\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u3084\u3001\u30c6\u30fc\u30d7\u5165\u529b\u306e\u3042\u308b\u30c7\u30b9\u30af\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u73fe\u5728\u3001MiSTer \u4e0a\u3067\u96fb\u5b50\u56de\u8def\u3092\uff08\u4f8b\u3048\u3070 SPICE ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/analogsim.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:21:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/mistercompile/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/mistercompile/", "title": "MiSTer\u5411\u3051\u30b3\u30f3\u30d1\u30a4\u30eb", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f\u8907\u6570\u306e\u30b3\u30f3\u30d1\u30a4\u30eb\u6e08\u307f\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u7d44\u307f\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30ab\u30b9\u30bf\u30de\u30a4\u30ba\u3055\u308c\u305f\u6700\u5c0f\u9650\u306e Linux \u30ab\u30fc\u30cd\u30eb\u3001\u30d6\u30fc\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30c0\u30fc\u3001C++ \u3067\u66f8\u304b\u308c\u305f Main MiSTer \u30d0\u30a4\u30ca\u30ea\u30fc\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066 VHDL\u3001Verilog\u3001SystemVerilog \u3067 MiSTer \u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u4e0a\u306b\u69cb\u7bc9\u3055\u308c\u305f\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30d5...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/mistercompile.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:21:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/porting/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/porting/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u79fb\u690d", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f\u304b\u306a\u308a\u8907\u96d1\u306a\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u3092\u4f7f\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u30aa\u30fc\u30d7\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30b9\u306e\u304a\u304b\u3052\u3067\u3001\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u3068\u30bd\u30d5\u30c8\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u306e\u77e5\u8b58\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u304c\u7570\u306a\u308b\u958b\u767a\u8005\u3067\u3082\u3053\u306e\u30d7\u30e9\u30c3\u30c8\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30e0\u5411\u3051\u306b\u958b\u767a\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u591a\u304f\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001<strong>\u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af</strong>\u3068\u547c\u3070\u308c\u308b\u5171\u901a\u306e\u307b\u307c\u540c\u4e00\u306e\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u30d6\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u5171\u6709\u3057\u3066\u304a\u308a\u3001\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u3068\u30d5\u30a1\u30fc\u30e0\u30a6\u30a7...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/porting.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:21:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/snippets/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/snippets/", "title": "\u4fbf\u5229\u306a\u30b9\u30cb\u30da\u30c3\u30c8", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u5168\u4f53\u3067\u4f7f\u308f\u308c\u308b\u4fbf\u5229\u306a HDL \u30b9\u30cb\u30da\u30c3\u30c8\u3092\u3001\u53c2\u8003\u7528\u306e\u30bd\u30fc\u30b9\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u4ed8\u304d\u3067\u7d39\u4ecb\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u30a4\u30cd\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u30b8\u30a7\u30cd\u30ec\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u3092\u4f7f\u3063\u305f\u30b7\u30f3\u30d7\u30eb\u306a\u30d4\u30af\u30bb\u30eb\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u5206\u5468</h2>\n<p>\u958b\u767a\u3059\u308b\u3069\u3093\u306a MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u3082\u3001<code>CE_PIXEL</code> \u306b\u306f\u30d4\u30af\u30bb\u30eb\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u306e\u30a4\u30cd\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u30d1\u30eb\u30b9\u3092\u99c6\u52d5\u3059\u308b\u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/snippets.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:21:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/computer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/computer/", "title": "Computer Core Networking", "content_html": "<h1>Computer core Internet and console connections</h1>\n<p>Since the May 7, 2018 release, MiSTer supports a serial (UART) connection from FPGA to Linux. Linux runs a ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/computer.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/lag/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/lag/", "title": "Lag Explained", "content_html": "<p>A common concern among retro enthusiasts is whether a device like MiSTer has <em>lag</em> and whether it creates a less desirable experience than original hardware....</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/lag.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/videoscaling/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/videoscaling/", "title": "Video Scaling", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer has a built-in scaler that converts the cores' low-resolution video to a higher resolution, optionally using filters to improve the picture on modern ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/videoscaling.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "title": "Controllers", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer supports a wide variety of input devices. It also offers options for configuring them and several quality-of-life features that work in most (sometime...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/input.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>The Sony PlayStation (PSX) MiSTer core is the most feature-filled and heavily developed core so far:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple controller options</li>\n<li>Automatic BIOS region s...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/component/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/component/", "title": "Core Component and Feature Usage", "content_html": "<p>This is a list of many recreated components used in various MiSTer FPGA cores. It is a manually maintained snapshot, not an exhaustive inventory.</p>\n<h2>AMP</h2>\n<h2>...</h2>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/component.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/emu/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/emu/", "title": "emu Module Overview", "content_html": "<p>On MiSTer, the top level is inside <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Template_MiSTer/blob/master/sys/sys_top.v\">sys/sys_top.v</a>{target=_blank}. When writing or...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/emu.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mra/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mra/", "title": "Arcade ROMs and MRA Files", "content_html": "<p>This page explains most of the intricacies of the way MiSTer handles ROMs for Arcade systems.</p>\n<h2>MRA Format</h2>\n<p>Because some arcade boards can change games by ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/mra.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/computer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/computer/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af", "content_html": "<h1>\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u63a5\u7d9a</h1>\n<p>2018\u5e745\u67087\u65e5\u306e\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u4ee5\u964d\u3001MiSTer \u306f FPGA \u304b\u3089 Linux \u3078\u306e\u30b7\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\uff08UART\uff09\u63a5\u7d9a\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002Linux \u306f\u3053\u306e\u63a5\u7d9a\u4e0a\u3067 PPP \u307e\u305f\u306f\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u3092\u52d5\u304b\u3057\u3001FPGA \u30b3\u30a2\u304b\u3089\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u3084 Linux \u30b7\u30a7\u30eb\u3078\u30a2\u30af...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/computer.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/lag/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/lag/", "title": "\u30e9\u30b0\u306e\u89e3\u8aac", "content_html": "<p>\u30ec\u30c8\u30ed\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u611b\u597d\u5bb6\u306e\u9593\u3067\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u61f8\u5ff5\u306f\u3001MiSTer \u306e\u3088\u3046\u306a\u6a5f\u5668\u306b_\u30e9\u30b0_\u304c\u3042\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u5b9f\u6a5f\u3088\u308a\u4f53\u9a13\u304c\u52a3\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\u96fb\u5b50\u6a5f\u5668\u306b\u306f\u4f55\u3089\u304b\u306e_\u30ec\u30a4\u30c6\u30f3\u30b7\u30fc_\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u554f\u984c\u306b\u306a\u308b\u306e\u306f\u305d\u306e\u30ec\u30a4\u30c6\u30f3\u30b7\u30fc\u304c\u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u306e\u53d6\u308a\u3053\u307c\u3057\u3092\u5f15\u304d\u8d77\u3053\u3059\u5834\u5408\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u30021\u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u901a\u5e38\u300160 \u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u6bce\u79d2\uff0860 ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/lag.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/videoscaling/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/videoscaling/", "title": "\u30d3\u30c7\u30aa\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u306f\u5185\u8535\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u304c\u3042\u308a\u3001\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u4f4e\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6\u6620\u50cf\u3092\u9ad8\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6\u306b\u5909\u63db\u3057\u3001\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3067\u30d5\u30a3\u30eb\u30bf\u30fc\u3092\u4f7f\u3063\u3066\u30e2\u30c0\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3067\u306e\u898b\u6804\u3048\u3092\u6539\u5584\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>Video Scale Mode\uff08vscale_mode\uff09</h2>\n<p>microSD \u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u76f4\u4e0b\u306e [...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/videoscaling.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/input/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/input/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f\u591a\u7a2e\u591a\u69d8\u306a\u5165\u529b\u6a5f\u5668\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3084\u3001\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306e\uff08\u5834\u5408\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u306f\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\uff09\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\u4fbf\u5229\u6a5f\u80fd\u3082\u5099\u3048\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u30b9\u30d4\u30ca\u30fc\u30fb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30d1\u30c3\u30c9\u30fb\u30b8\u30e7\u30a4\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30c3\u30af\u30fb\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306a\u3069\u306e\u6a5f\u5668\u306e\u7279\u6b8a\u306a\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u30